certflow
title Keyhive Lab Note #7: a more involved example
(Thread 1)-[admin(Thread 1)]->(Commenters)  : Thread 1 is created
(Commenters)-[admin(Commenters)]->(Alice)   : Alice creates Commenters
(Alice)-[edit(Commenters)]->(Carol)         : Carol can comment
(Alice)-[edit(Commenters)]->(Bob)           : Bob can comment
(Thread 2)-[admin(Thread 2)]->(Commenters)  : Thread 2 is created
(Essay)-[admin(Essay)]->(Alice)             : The Essay grants Alice Admin
(Alice)-[read(Essay)]->(Commenters)         : Commenters can read the Essay
